  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"WkyY2\" id=\"WkyY2\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5347f2a0\" id=\"u5347f2a0\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">驱动可以传递的参数类型</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"ud5d3ee02\" id=\"ud5d3ee02\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf3e60c17\" id=\"uf3e60c17\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">驱动传递参数的类型分成三类：</span></p><ul list=\"ucb8629dc\"><li fid=\"u5d36ac05\" data-lake-id=\"u36f61f72\" id=\"u36f61f72\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua9addcf0\" id=\"ua9addcf0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">基本类型</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1d0a6fcf\" id=\"u1d0a6fcf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：char, bool, int, long, short, byte, ushort, uint。</span></li><li fid=\"u5d36ac05\" data-lake-id=\"u107a669d\" id=\"u107a669d\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2c005d37\" id=\"u2c005d37\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">数组</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7b6050bd\" id=\"u7b6050bd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：array</span></li><li fid=\"u5d36ac05\" data-lake-id=\"uaa9bd844\" id=\"uaa9bd844\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u54e85446\" id=\"u54e85446\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">字符串</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u48aaa919\" id=\"u48aaa919\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：string</span></li></ul><h1 data-lake-id=\"ZXkTP\" id=\"ZXkTP\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1333997e\" id=\"u1333997e\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">如何给驱动传参</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u4c952c4d\" id=\"u4c952c4d\"><span data-lake-id=\"uba8c4453\" id=\"uba8c4453\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">驱动支持的参数类型有基本类型，数组，字符串。这三个类型分别对应函数：</span></p><ul list=\"u4ea231c0\"><li fid=\"u093331b6\" data-lake-id=\"u7f034aaa\" id=\"u7f034aaa\"><code data-lake-id=\"uddbd9a40\" id=\"uddbd9a40\"><span data-lake-id=\"u02ad0967\" id=\"u02ad0967\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">module_param</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u996d9c68\" id=\"u996d9c68\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：传递基本类型函数</span></li><li fid=\"u093331b6\" data-lake-id=\"u29fe14ac\" id=\"u29fe14ac\"><code data-lake-id=\"ue1230328\" id=\"ue1230328\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9ae2b213\" id=\"u9ae2b213\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">module_param_array</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u42db9f81\" id=\"u42db9f81\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：传递数组类型函数</span></li><li fid=\"u093331b6\" data-lake-id=\"u36aa0cf0\" id=\"u36aa0cf0\"><code data-lake-id=\"u0ddc17fd\" id=\"u0ddc17fd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u91ca466f\" id=\"u91ca466f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">module_param_string</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0b51611b\" id=\"u0b51611b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：传递字符串类型函数</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"ua885f5b7\" id=\"ua885f5b7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9fc57c32\" id=\"u9fc57c32\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">这三个函数在 Linux 内核源码 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ud61b9b9b\" id=\"ud61b9b9b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ueaa5f565\" id=\"ueaa5f565\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">include/linux/moduleparam.h</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u364ddcaa\" id=\"u364ddcaa\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\"> 中有定义，如下：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23define%20module_param(name%2C%20type%2C%20perm)%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20module_param_named(name%2C%20name%2C%20type%2C%20perm)%5Cn%5Cn%23define%20module_param_array(name%2C%20type%2C%20nump%2C%20perm)%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20module_param_array_named(name%2C%20name%2C%20type%2C%20nump%2C%20perm)%5Cn%5Cn%23define%20module_param_string(name%2C%20string%2C%20len%2C%20perm)%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20static%20const%20struct%20kparam_string%20__param_string_%23%23name%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3D%20%7B%20len%2C%20string%20%7D%3B%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20__module_param_call(MODULE_PARAM_PREFIX%2C%20name%2C%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%26param_ops_string%2C%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.str%20%3D%20%26__param_string_%23%23name%2C%20perm%2C%20-1%2C%200)%3B%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20__MODULE_PARM_TYPE(name%2C%20%5C%22string%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jD0PT%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"gpC4o\" id=\"gpC4o\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8b954346\" id=\"u8b954346\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">module_param函数</span></h2><ul list=\"u1592d7a8\"><li fid=\"u1985f6cc\" data-lake-id=\"u07efb486\" id=\"u07efb486\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u73a86ca2\" id=\"u73a86ca2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">函数功能</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubbbd08ba\" id=\"ubbbd08ba\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：传递基本类型参数给驱动</span></li><li fid=\"u1985f6cc\" data-lake-id=\"u74e8faaa\" id=\"u74e8faaa\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u43646f5f\" id=\"u43646f5f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">函数原型</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u659c044b\" id=\"u659c044b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u141b753c\" id=\"u141b753c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6b1eb3bb\" id=\"u6b1eb3bb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">module_param(name, type, perm);</span></code></li><li fid=\"u1985f6cc\" data-lake-id=\"u58447d77\" id=\"u58447d77\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u373b7259\" id=\"u373b7259\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">函数参数</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub592dac7\" id=\"ub592dac7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u1592d7a8\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ue29a0c11\" data-lake-id=\"u0cb35593\" id=\"u0cb35593\"><code data-lake-id=\"u382ce8fd\" id=\"u382ce8fd\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub26c89c6\" id=\"ub26c89c6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">name</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3eb49a66\" id=\"u3eb49a66\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：要传递给驱动代码中的变量的名字。</span></li><li fid=\"ue29a0c11\" data-lake-id=\"ud1b66824\" id=\"ud1b66824\"><code data-lake-id=\"ub79f1023\" id=\"ub79f1023\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7d242d56\" id=\"u7d242d56\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">type</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u72ea9684\" id=\"u72ea9684\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：参数类型。</span></li><li fid=\"ue29a0c11\" data-lake-id=\"u61bf1358\" id=\"u61bf1358\"><code data-lake-id=\"u488e34d1\" id=\"u488e34d1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue875f15e\" id=\"ue875f15e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">perm</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u26c2871a\" id=\"u26c2871a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：参数的读写权限。</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"vhBcy\" id=\"vhBcy\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uab1f2884\" id=\"uab1f2884\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">module_param_array函数</span></strong></h2><ul list=\"u9a28bf7a\"><li fid=\"u3ef34aa6\" data-lake-id=\"u57d80bc7\" id=\"u57d80bc7\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua31b4002\" id=\"ua31b4002\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">函数功能</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua4fba3a3\" id=\"ua4fba3a3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：传递数组类型参数给驱动</span></li><li fid=\"u3ef34aa6\" data-lake-id=\"u068fca98\" id=\"u068fca98\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u98e9b2c8\" id=\"u98e9b2c8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">函数原型</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u12cb59f5\" id=\"u12cb59f5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：</span><code data-lake-id=\"ued5c4625\" id=\"ued5c4625\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc14fc332\" id=\"uc14fc332\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">module_param_array(name, type, nump, perm);</span></code></li><li fid=\"u3ef34aa6\" data-lake-id=\"u2fc90f33\" id=\"u2fc90f33\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub3af5378\" id=\"ub3af5378\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">函数参数</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u36ce00be\" id=\"u36ce00be\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u9a28bf7a\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u493f57b7\" data-lake-id=\"u4c31ce92\" id=\"u4c31ce92\"><code data-lake-id=\"uf4544458\" id=\"uf4544458\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1bda126b\" id=\"u1bda126b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">name</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u67ccedfb\" id=\"u67ccedfb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：要传递给驱动代码中的变量的名字。</span></li><li fid=\"u493f57b7\" data-lake-id=\"ub4cd9e1a\" id=\"ub4cd9e1a\"><code data-lake-id=\"u6c8b0cc5\" id=\"u6c8b0cc5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0efe762e\" id=\"u0efe762e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">type</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub7db43fb\" id=\"ub7db43fb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：参数类型。</span></li><li fid=\"u493f57b7\" data-lake-id=\"u4e97367d\" id=\"u4e97367d\"><code data-lake-id=\"u3fe46004\" id=\"u3fe46004\"><span data-lake-id=\"u23f522cc\" id=\"u23f522cc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">nump</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8c92c0fe\" id=\"u8c92c0fe\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：数组的长度。</span></li><li fid=\"u493f57b7\" data-lake-id=\"u7be1151f\" id=\"u7be1151f\"><code data-lake-id=\"u044c750e\" id=\"u044c750e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubbb46dc1\" id=\"ubbb46dc1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">perm</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u82748fa1\" id=\"u82748fa1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：参数的读写权限。</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"oaQFo\" id=\"oaQFo\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u77489a94\" id=\"u77489a94\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">module_param_string函数</span></strong></h2><ul list=\"u93256141\"><li fid=\"ub5945054\" data-lake-id=\"ufe7c8341\" id=\"ufe7c8341\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u85829e0e\" id=\"u85829e0e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">函数功能</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u21b9d311\" id=\"u21b9d311\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：传递字符串类型参数给驱动</span></li><li fid=\"ub5945054\" data-lake-id=\"u102b058c\" id=\"u102b058c\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7a47817a\" id=\"u7a47817a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">函数原型</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf7850a38\" id=\"uf7850a38\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u82da54a5\" id=\"u82da54a5\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud9b4182b\" id=\"ud9b4182b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">module_param_string(name, string, len, perm);</span></code></li><li fid=\"ub5945054\" data-lake-id=\"ua6dc6215\" id=\"ua6dc6215\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uaf79052b\" id=\"uaf79052b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">函数参数</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6219b2d2\" id=\"u6219b2d2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u93256141\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u520ece62\" data-lake-id=\"ud82a1681\" id=\"ud82a1681\"><code data-lake-id=\"u55d4373f\" id=\"u55d4373f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u436436a0\" id=\"u436436a0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">name</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u9782c7b6\" id=\"u9782c7b6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：要传递给驱动代码中的变量的名字。</span></li><li fid=\"u520ece62\" data-lake-id=\"u4a52d5c3\" id=\"u4a52d5c3\"><code data-lake-id=\"udfe5aee3\" id=\"udfe5aee3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7b781f5c\" id=\"u7b781f5c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">string</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc69384c1\" id=\"uc69384c1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：驱动程序中变量的名字，要和参数 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u62ffcb42\" id=\"u62ffcb42\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf4b431c7\" id=\"uf4b431c7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">name</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u94407eac\" id=\"u94407eac\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\"> 的名字保持一致。</span></li><li fid=\"u520ece62\" data-lake-id=\"u2ebe9d03\" id=\"u2ebe9d03\"><code data-lake-id=\"u7dc4d5cb\" id=\"u7dc4d5cb\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua5ecb262\" id=\"ua5ecb262\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">len</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua5c640d4\" id=\"ua5c640d4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：字符串的大小。</span></li><li fid=\"u520ece62\" data-lake-id=\"u71af8ac6\" id=\"u71af8ac6\"><code data-lake-id=\"ua61f0d3b\" id=\"ua61f0d3b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue11c033a\" id=\"ue11c033a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">perm</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc31270b0\" id=\"uc31270b0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：参数的读写权限。</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"SWAzL\" id=\"SWAzL\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u203204ed\" id=\"u203204ed\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">MODULE_PARM_DESC函数</span></strong></h2><ul list=\"u680b6bd5\"><li fid=\"u4568263b\" data-lake-id=\"uf9ee8300\" id=\"uf9ee8300\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u83a31287\" id=\"u83a31287\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">函数功能</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u72ade063\" id=\"u72ade063\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：描述模块参数的信息。在 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u11b67186\" id=\"u11b67186\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5f075ea5\" id=\"u5f075ea5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">include/linux/moduleparam.h</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ubfefa6b9\" id=\"ubfefa6b9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\"> 定义</span></li><li fid=\"u4568263b\" data-lake-id=\"uc8ed7829\" id=\"uc8ed7829\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7ee4ca7d\" id=\"u7ee4ca7d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">函数原型</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8df2f241\" id=\"u8df2f241\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u7acc3125\" id=\"u7acc3125\"><span data-lake-id=\"u80fa42e7\" id=\"u80fa42e7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">MODULE_PARM_DESC(_parm, desc)</span></code></li><li fid=\"u4568263b\" data-lake-id=\"ud8ada9d0\" id=\"ud8ada9d0\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4401a18e\" id=\"u4401a18e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">函数参数</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufcd8ddfc\" id=\"ufcd8ddfc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u680b6bd5\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ufc5f0188\" data-lake-id=\"uecfa77bc\" id=\"uecfa77bc\"><code data-lake-id=\"u18acb730\" id=\"u18acb730\"><span data-lake-id=\"u25dabd00\" id=\"u25dabd00\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">_parm</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uea453e63\" id=\"uea453e63\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：要描述的参数的参数名称。</span></li><li fid=\"ufc5f0188\" data-lake-id=\"u5b80c981\" id=\"u5b80c981\"><code data-lake-id=\"u8b87efb2\" id=\"u8b87efb2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u16323189\" id=\"u16323189\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">desc</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u58218141\" id=\"u58218141\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">：描述信息。</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"z4STZ\" id=\"z4STZ\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue5b89f80\" id=\"ue5b89f80\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">参数的读写权限</span></strong></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uc7594cdc\" id=\"uc7594cdc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8b7c745f\" id=\"u8b7c745f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">读写权限在 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ua485f7db\" id=\"ua485f7db\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue7575c86\" id=\"ue7575c86\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">include/linux/stat.h</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u07503da6\" id=\"u07503da6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\"> 和 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u457de498\" id=\"u457de498\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6ed883e9\" id=\"u6ed883e9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">include/uapi/linux/stat.h</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uda47d5b6\" id=\"uda47d5b6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\"> 下有定义，一般使用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u7c2fa602\" id=\"u7c2fa602\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf6a4c655\" id=\"uf6a4c655\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">S_IRUGO</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc427f1a6\" id=\"uc427f1a6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">，也可以使用数字表示，如 444 表示 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u5cdb531d\" id=\"u5cdb531d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3ad6ac79\" id=\"u3ad6ac79\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">S_IRUGO</span></code></p><p data-lake-id=\"u986dd2b4\" id=\"u986dd2b4\"><code data-lake-id=\"uae0c3a4a\" id=\"uae0c3a4a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ued3fccd9\" id=\"ued3fccd9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">include/linux/stat.h</span></strong></code><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub387deaa\" id=\"ub387deaa\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">中的权限定义:</span></strong></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23define%20S_IRWXU%2000700%5Cn%23define%20S_IRUSR%2000400%5Cn%23define%20S_IWUSR%2000200%5Cn%23define%20S_IXUSR%2000100%5Cn%5Cn%23define%20S_IRWXG%2000070%5Cn%23define%20S_IRGRP%2000040%5Cn%23define%20S_IWGRP%2000020%5Cn%23define%20S_IXGRP%2000010%5Cn%5Cn%23define%20